{"id":"658041","name":"酸菜炒肥肠","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658041/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肥肠","amount":"2条"},{"name":"酸菜","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜丝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"1个"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"2根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"肥肠用盐和面粉抓洗干净。","img":"images/658041/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"酸菜切片。","img":"images/658041/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备适量的葱花、姜丝和小米辣。","img":"images/658041/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用黄豆酱、蚝油、酱油、淀粉和小半碗水，调一个酱汁。","img":"images/658041/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅内煮开水，放入葱、姜、料酒，肥肠焯水5分钟左右。","img":"images/658041/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出。","img":"images/658041/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"切成小段。","img":"images/658041/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"起锅烧油，放入酸菜翻炒，炒熟铲出备用。","img":"images/658041/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中再次热油，放入姜丝和小米椒。","img":"images/658041/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入肥肠翻炒，放少许盐入味。","img":"images/658041/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入料酒。","img":"images/658041/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入酸菜翻炒。","img":"images/658041/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"倒入酱汁。","img":"images/658041/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"大火收汁。","img":"images/658041/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"最后放入葱花增鲜即可。","img":"images/658041/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658041/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}